  m_Name: 8Golem
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CardData
  CardPages:
  - Please welcome, Type IV Golem! Your guard and others like him guard the royal
    castle.
  - These are... people. They are assembled from several bodies on a night of secrets,
    infused with life, and preserved by mechanisms.
  - They were mass-produced during the war, and now the remaining ones are guarded
    by noble families.
  - And I want to get rid of them.
  - People are afraid of them. And they don't want to become one of them.
  - I ask that most of these creatures be put into hibernation so that my people
    can guard you with greater zeal.
  Card_name: Chief of the Guard
